    <string name="coach_hc_title">Watch and scale (Health Connect)</string>
    <string name="coach_hc_text">Steps, active calories, sleep, resting heart rate, weight and body fat from your watch (e.g. Garmin) or scale. dmOffice only reads and writes nothing back; the values only go to your own server.</string>
    <string name="coach_hc_last">Last synced: %1$s</string>
    <string name="coach_hc_disconnect">Disconnect</string>
    <string name="coach_hc_days">%1$d days imported</string>
    <string name="coach_hc_rationale_title">Health data in Coach</string>
    <string name="coach_hc_rationale">dmOffice reads steps, active calories, distance, sleep, resting heart rate, weight and body fat from Health Connect to show them in Coach and compare them with your goals. The data only goes to the dmOffice server you connected the app to and is stored encrypted in your account there. It is neither passed on to third parties nor used for advertising. You can revoke access in Health Connect at any time and delete all data in Coach.</string>
